WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.567
The takeaway: treating bisimulation as an
equivalence over tasks, not just states,

00:00:05.647 --> 00:00:08.046
aligns analogous tasks in one space.

00:00:08.126 --> 00:00:11.214
Because goals become composable by arithmetic,

00:00:11.294 --> 00:00:15.828
you can point a robot at an example and have it
infer its own goal,

00:00:15.908 --> 00:00:19.340
provably sufficient for any state-only reward task.
